MASTER PROMPT: BENEFICIARY NOMINATION SYSTEM
Enterprise UI/UX Design Inspired by Workday
1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE
Design and develop a modern, responsive, enterprise-grade Beneficiary Nomination Management System.
The application will allow employees to nominate and manage beneficiaries for pension funds, insurance schemes, provident funds, death benefits, and other company-related benefit schemes.
The application must provide different interfaces based on user roles:
Employee
Principal Officer
Pension Manager
Administrator
The system's backend infrastructure already exists and is implemented using SharePoint Lists, Power Automate Flows, and configured APIs.
IMPORTANT: Do not rebuild, duplicate, or introduce new business workflow logic. The front end must integrate with the existing backend infrastructure.
The primary objective is to deliver an excellent enterprise UI/UX experience inspired by Workday's design philosophy.
